------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Attribution and Research Citation Notice
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This software is an independent cleanroom implementation of the algorithmic
framework and methodology described in the research publication:

  "Dreaming While Exploring: Recursive Self-Improvement in LLM-Based Discovery Systems"
  Authors: Kid Zheng et al.
  Reference: arXiv:2609.14858 (2026)
  Official Repository: https://github.com/zhengkid/Dream-RSI

This codebase was developed independently from the published paper text and
specifications. It does not reproduce or incorporate copyrighted source code
from the original authors. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or sponsored by the original authors or their affiliated institutions.
